WEBVTT

00:06:57.315 --> 00:07:00.478
People make it so easy
for me to talk to them,

00:07:00.502 --> 00:07:03.961
but they make it so hard
for me to teach them.

00:07:04.502 --> 00:07:07.834
I want them to have the confidence
to always do their best.

00:07:08.236 --> 00:07:10.800
I want them to have
the heart and the courage

00:07:10.824 --> 00:07:11.974
to love the world,

00:07:12.768 --> 00:07:14.530
just like you taught me.

00:07:14.554 --> 00:07:16.455
I wrote this letter to thank you.

00:07:16.895 --> 00:07:19.672
Thank you for inviting me
to love the world

00:07:19.696 --> 00:07:21.439
since the moment I was born.

00:07:21.947 --> 00:07:23.836
Thank you for laughing at everything.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.348
Thank you for teaching me

00:07:25.372 --> 00:07:29.727
that hope and optimism
are the most powerful tools we have

00:07:29.751 --> 00:07:31.431
to tackle any problem.